The rate-based QUIC controller code in this directory is original queqiao code.
The pacing design and Brutal controller behavior are informed by the MIT-
licensed Hysteria 2 project (https://github.com/apernet/hysteria), whose
copyright notices are retained here for attribution. queqiao does not import
Hysteria's internal packages.

The optional TUIC-aligned BBR controller is an independent Go implementation
of the public BBR model and the behavior documented by TUIC's
quinn-congestions project (https://github.com/Tipuch/quinn-congestions). The
reference implementation credits Google's BSD-licensed BBR design; queqiao
does not copy Rust source or link to that crate.
